    "description": "<p>Your speech is imbued with power. After a long rest, place a number of tokens on this card equal to your Presence. When you speak with an ally, you can spend a token from this card to give them one benefit from the following options:</p><ul><li class=\"vertical-card-list-found\"><p>Your ally clears a Stress.</p></li><li class=\"vertical-card-list-found\"><p>Your ally clears a Hit Point.</p></li><li class=\"vertical-card-list-found\"><p>Your ally gains a Hope.</p></li></ul><p>When you take a long rest, clear all unspent tokens.</p>",
